 .../test_web_openai_native_autodetect.py      | 87 +++++++++++++++++++
 tools/web_tools.py                            | 15 +++-
 tools/web_tools_rescue.py                     |  4 +
 6 files changed, 124 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
